      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Since Invites and invite replies can have messages attached to them, people can technically talk like that at the moment.\n\nSo this would be viable in my opinion.\n\nOne downside i can think of though is people focusing on typing instead of meeting up, which could reduce the social reach that people will partake in",
