  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "wouldn't it be cool to message someone without having to add them on discord or send an invite? how about a dedicated vrc instant messaging feature for only vrc plus users. this will increase the amount of people wanting a subscription and save time. similar to rec room when you spawn into an instance a \"chatroom\" will be there for players not so quick to join the conversation who just joined and want be apart instead of the opposite. this will also help the \"chat\" side of vrc. (hopefully this will decrease mirror dwelling) I truly believe that instant messaging is a must in a platform where chatting is required.",
